1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,820
You know this story. Weeks of late nights, poured into one project!

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,470
An app!

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,380
A report!

4
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,370
A pitch deck!

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,210
And then? Nothing.

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,010
They take it to meetings.

7
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:18,360
Long pages!

8
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,830
Endless slides!

9
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:21,100
Diagrams!

10
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:23,930
And everyone tunes out.

11
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,530
Great films take great crews!

12
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:30,470
Every job, a specialist.

13
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:38,650
Real craft. But small projects rarely get one.

14
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,970
What if your project made its own trailer?

15
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:44,650
One prompt starts it!

16
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:45,860
The script!

17
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:47,170
The scenes!

18
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,360
The voice!

19
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:49,660
The music!

20
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:51,700
And out comes your film!

21
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:56,440
Step one. Your project files go in.

22
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:59,510
Code! Documents! Slides! Spreadsheets!

23
00:00:59,710 --> 00:01:03,280
An AI assistant reads them, and drafts your script.

24
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:07,620
Step two. Your story, alive in three D!

25
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,580
Streets! People! Motion!

26
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,100
Any angle!

27
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:13,630
All of it, just code!

28
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:18,190
Step three. An AI voice tells it.

29
00:01:18,290 --> 00:01:20,590
Choose a voice! Choose a language!

30
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,260
Timed to every scene.

31
00:01:23,050 --> 00:01:25,550
Change a word? It is spoken again.

32
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:30,510
Step four. A backing track, made in code.

33
00:01:30,610 --> 00:01:33,120
Chords! Drums! Bass! Melody!

34
00:01:35,340 --> 00:01:40,840
No song copied. No artist imitated. Real songs need real musicians!

35
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:44,970
Step five. One single page.

36
00:01:46,250 --> 00:01:47,350
Laptop!

37
00:01:47,450 --> 00:01:48,360
Phone!

38
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:49,600
Big screen!

39
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:52,090
Or export an MP4, and share it!

40
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:55,450
And now?

41
00:01:55,550 --> 00:01:56,630
They stop.

42
00:01:56,730 --> 00:01:57,800
They watch.

43
00:01:57,900 --> 00:02:01,230
The same people. The same project. Finally seen!

44
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:07,770
This trailer was made with the prompt and the tools you just saw. Yours could be next!
